+    ["|cffff4040!Astrolabe introuvable|r - Interface\\AddOns\\!Astrolabe doit etre present et active."] = "|cffff4040!Astrolabe no encontrado|r - Interface\\AddOns\\!Astrolabe debe estar presente y activado.",
